OL,3,GNEWSA'Rok' solid recognition for
OL,4,ASlovenian space scientist
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a child growing up in Slovenia in
OL,7,F1999, Dr Rok NeE>iDM couldn't have
OL,8,Fknown that an asteroid that was
OL,9,Fdiscovered in New Mexico that year
OL,10,Fwould be named after him almost three
OL,11,Fdecades later.
OL,13,FThe Orchard County may be best known
OL,14,Ffor its apples, but for NeE>iDM the
OL,15,Freal attraction was astronomy.
OL,17,FHe first arrived at Armagh Observatory
OL,18,Fand Planetarium (AOP) in 2015 to
OL,19,Fcomplete his doctorate in space and
OL,20,Fclimate physics, and has remained there
OL,21,Fever since.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
