OL,3,GNEWSA'Rok' solid recognition for
OL,4,ASlovenian space scientist
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a decade on, he is one of two
OL,7,FAOP employees to have recently been
OL,8,Fchosen to have a celestial body named
OL,9,Fafter them.
